  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><p><strong>ABOUT OUR BRAND &amp; PRODUCTS</strong></p><p><strong>LifeArtists® | LifeArtists999 </strong>is a conscious lifestyle and apparel brand rooted in self-awareness, creativity, and shared hue-manity. Our designs are symbolic, intentional, and created to be worn as reminders of inner authorship, courage, and conscious living. Each <strong>masterp(ea)ce </strong>blends art, meaning, and quality — turning values into wearable expression. ✨👕</p><p>✶ ✶ ✶</p><p><strong>WHAT MAKES US DIFFERENT</strong></p><p><strong>LifeArtists® </strong>is not fast fashion. It is a movement-driven brand built on inclusivity, integrity, and global unity. We welcome all ages, cultures, and backgrounds — from conscious adults to families and next-generation creators. Our collections include <strong>LifeArtists999</strong> and <strong>LifeArtistsKids</strong>, designed to empower individuals and families through symbolism, storytelling, and soul-aligned design. 🌈🕊️</p><p>✶ ✶ ✶</p><p><strong>HOW AFFILIATES CAN EARN</strong></p><p><strong>Affiliates</strong> earn a 20% commission on every successful order generated through their unique affiliate link or coupon code. A 30-day tracking cookie ensures fair attribution, supporting both short-term and long-term promotion. 💸🤝</p><p>✶ ✶ ✶</p><p><strong>HOW TO PROMOTE US</strong></p><p>Affiliates are encouraged to promote <strong>LifeArtists® </strong>authentically through social media, video content, storytelling, and community-based sharing. Content that reflects personal experience, values, and genuine connection performs best. <strong>Creativity</strong>, <strong>honesty</strong>, and <strong>alignment</strong> are always welcome. 📲🎥</p><p>✶ ✶ ✶</p><p><strong>OTHER IMPORTANT INFORMATION</strong></p><p><strong>LifeArtists®</strong> is family-friendly, globally accessible, and purpose-led. The brand supports <strong>conscious living</strong>, <strong>creative freedom</strong>, and <strong>ethical collaboration</strong>. Our <strong>MagiX universe</strong> also includes symbolic guides such as <strong>Lumi the Wolficornfly </strong>and his growing family, representing imagination, courage, and shared unity. 🌈🐺🦋</p></div>",
